 "build": {
  "id": "4982a420-3c4b-4d33-9193-1dc5137cbd87",
  "title": "Grovekeeper Raid and Dungeon Healer",
  "description": "[overview]\nThis is an AoE-focused healing build with decent single-target for bosses with CDs. I've only been playing Primalist since the project started and have tried min-maxing different builds for each melee spec.\n\n*I run this build with my guild as 4 DPS + 1 Tank. You need someone to queue as a healer and play DPS for you since we cannot queue as a healer ourselves.\n\n[talents]\nKey talents here are Nature's Blessing, Ancient of War, Sacred Grove, and Earthmother's Roar.\n\nFlex talents can be Ride the Wave and Earthmother's Empowerment for faster dungeon running.\n\n[rotation]\nKey Rotation:\n\nUse Primal Awakening on pull. (Lust)\n\nOpen with Primal Rush (on your party)>Spirit Charge (on your tank)>Grove Guardian>Seismic Wave>Earthquake proc. Then spam Wildclaws until Seismic Wave is off CD.\n\nMaintain Flourishing Growth (on party) and Heavy-Handed (on tank). Maintain at least 1 Earthquake on the ground.\n\nSpot heal as needed with Hand of the Earthmother. Emergency heal with Sacred Grove and Protective Roar.\n\n*Grove Guardian is uncapped AoE DPS/Healing and should always be taken.\n\n[stats]\nBIS Stats are going off of bisbeard.com\n\nStrength, Attack Power, Crit, and Agility are all going to be top for this build.\n\nAny crafted item with the of the Champion prefix.",
