 "comments": [
  {
   "id": "ebb2c537-658a-4100-ad07-a9619ce4c83e",
   "build_id": "4982a420-3c4b-4d33-9193-1dc5137cbd87",
   "author_id": "bccac39b-b2ee-4e84-961b-bca3e4d0e10b",
   "parent_id": null,
   "body": "I would strongly suggest trying boulder rolling giant groups of enemies. With high enough crit chance I'm hitting 20k dps on very large pulls since boulder counts as a melee hit the amount of damage and healing is extremely satisfying. Its also just very funny looking and fun to control, rolling back and forth on a giant stacked pack, my friends always laugh when the see me rollin on it.",
